  m_Name: CinemachineShakeCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples::xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.SampleCard
  Title: Cinemachine Shake Lab
  Try: "Shake with 1 2 3, press Z for the plain camera and shake again \u2014 the
    same players. Try the Cinemachine items with C V."
  See: 'One shake path: the main camera''s shake goes through the Cinemachine shake
    extension or the plain camera''s transform. The Cinemachine items play on the
    Cinemachine camera only, a lens button when the lens has that size. Each camera
    switch allocates once (then 0 B). Impulse Clear and the Go buttons run in Before
    too.'
  Controls: "1 2 3 \u2014 presets \xB7 Z \u2014 plain or Cinemachine \xB7 X \u2014
    endless \xB7 C V \xB7 D-pad \u2014 pick \xB7 play an item"
  SceneGuid: bff857b4aaf2342c4a050b7fe902914b
  SceneName: CinemachineShakeLab
  RequiredType: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.CinemachineShakeLab, xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.CinemachineShake
  RequiresText: Cinemachine 3 or later
